      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "三条阅读分支",
      "items": [
        "01–03 价值型：Q-learning → DQN → Double / Dueling，离散动作",
        "04–08 策略梯度：REINFORCE → Actor-Critic → TRPO → PPO",
        "09–11 连续控制：DDPG → TD3 → SAC，off-policy + replay"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "共享模块约定",
      "items": [
        "03–11 通常拆为 config / environment / agents / networks / trainer / main",
        "off-policy 用 ReplayBuffer；on-policy 用回合 rollout",
        "DDPG / TD3 额外有 noise.py；SAC 由随机策略自带探索"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "文档与输出",
      "items": [
        "根 README.md 给目录表，算法路线.md 给继承关系",
        "每个目录的 经验总结.md 回答特点、缺陷、局限、场景四问",
        "05 / 06 的 output 保存 CSV 与曲线；06 另存 actor_critic.pt"
      ]
    }
